      <h3 class="feed-section-label feed-section-label--sub"><span class="feed-section-stamp">How I work</span></h3>
      <p class="ethos">
        I care about <strong>infrastructure, not app surface area</strong>. The systems I find interesting are the ones other engineers build on top of: a renderer, a capture pipeline, a physics engine, a GPU scheduler. I profile before optimizing, I read the paper before reimplementing, and I'd rather ship one well-understood 75K-line engine than three shallow demos.
